{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42134","headline":"秋日雨中与萧赞善访殷舍人於翰林座中作 · 徐铉","name":"秋日雨中与萧赞善访殷舍人於翰林座中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野出西垣步步迟，秋光如水雨如丝。\n铜龙楼下逢闲客，红药堦前访旧知。\n乱点乍滋承露处，碎声因想滴蓬时。\n银台钥入须归去，不惜余欢尽酒巵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42134.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42134","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}